                "reply_count": 35,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "Tami and her husband, both 64, rely on the ACA for health care. With current subsidies, her premiums are $504 a month, but without them, they'll jump to $1,360. As Tami put it, \"My husband and I worked our whole lives and planned carefully for retirement \u2014 but this was not in the plan.\"\n\nNo one should have to choose between critical care and retirement. Democrats are fighting to protect these tax credits so families like hers can keep their coverage.",
