                "reply_count": 32,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Across Colorado, people are sharing how ACA tax credits make health care possible, from lowering monthly costs to keeping retirement within reach. These stories show what\u2019s at stake and why protecting the ACA matters for every family. \n\nAfter being laid off at 62, my constituent Mike faced the reality of losing his health coverage right before retirement. Thanks to the ACA tax credits, he was able to stay insured. Without them, coverage would be out of reach. His story is a reminder that these subsidies aren't just policy but a necessity for thousands of Coloradans just trying to keep their health care.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1761863656,
                "view_count": 1561
            },
