                "quoted_status_profile_username": "NBCNews",
                "reply_count": 265,
                "retweet_count": 109,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This is not a deal. This does nothing to address the skyrocketing costs of health care facing American families and I would never trust a \u201cpromise\u201d to vote on the ACA later from Republicans. While I join all of you in deep disappointment, this fight is far from over.",
