                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1756,
                "retweet_count": 114,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "Republicans created this health care crisis and they\u2019re doing nothing but perpetuating it.\n\nAnd there is a very real human cost \u2013 people will go without health insurance, some will go without life-saving care altogether, and the cost of health care will go up for every one of us.\n\nDonald Trump and Republicans refused to come to the table and negotiate with us, and our families will pay the price.",
