                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "No one should have to choose between financial ruin or giving up the care they need. One firefighter from my district told me his annual medical costs will jump from $13,000 to $26,000. That's untenable for working families like his.\n\nStories like his are why we have to keep fighting to lower costs & support regular people, not billionaires and millionaires. We only have until the end of the month for a real solution that keeps health care affordable and doesn't leave Coloradans without the critical care they need.",
