                "text": "Pregnant women in ICE custody are being shackled & denied care. I'm appalled \u2014 this administration's cruelty knows no bounds. \n\nEVERYONE, no matter their immigration status, deserves dignity, safety, and access to health care. I joined my colleagues calling on @DHSgov, who must respond about this illegal detainment and mistreatment of pregnant women.\nhttps://t.co/04N9fsWoWp",
