                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans have had a \"concept of a plan\" for 15 years, but still haven't offered a real alternative to the ACA.\n\nNow, at the 11th hour, they're scrambling with something that does nothing to address rising costs & support regular families and kicks millions off their health care. If Republicans want to show they're serious about lowering health care costs, they can join our discharge petition to force a vote to extend the ACA tax credits & prevent premiums from skyrocketing. We only need 4 Republicans to do the right thing.",
