                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "The window of opportunity to fix the Republican health care crisis closes in just 17 days before Americans are forced to foot the bill for their incompetence for the next year. \n\nThat means families are going to be stuck with health care premiums two or 3x more than last year. This is life-or-death for far too many Americans, but the consequences of rising costs will impact all of us. \n\nTo my Republican colleagues: you control the House, the Senate, & the Presidency \u2014 the lives that are lost unnecessarily will be because of your backwards priorities.",
